<speak>I have my identification details in front of me as well. My identification number is <sub alias="gee">G</sub> seven one seven eight eight seven seven <sub alias="ar">R</sub>. My date of birth is 10 January 1950. I would rather deal with those at the beginning and then put that particular sheet away. I have become more careful about what I leave on the table when the family visits. There is nothing dramatic behind that; I simply used to have a secretary who made sure everything went back into its proper place.</speak>